    "dropdown_with_image_eG3hhh": {
      "type": "dropdown-with-image",
      "blocks": {
        "dropdown_qaBenK": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The 64 Ways Audio Collection",
            "text": "<p>The 64 Ways are potent oral transmissions of each Gene Key, recorded by Richard Rudd. Offering a fresh perspective from the Gene Keys book, these audios are spoken in a contemplative style that blends practical guidance, poetic insight, and gentle humor. They serve as mini-courses in themselves, designed to support your ongoing Gene Keys journey.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/64-Ways-iPhone-Mockup.png",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_6WgJdG": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": true,
            "title": "The Art of Contemplation Course",
            "text": "<p>This beautifully simple mini-course invites you to pause and reconnect with the heart of your being. Poetic, refined, and eminently practical, it introduces the contemplative technique at the core of the Gene Keys and of all true paths of wisdom.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Art of Contemplation helps you bring stillness, clarity, and spaciousness into every aspect of life. Step-by-step resources, audiobook teachings by Richard Rudd, and practices for “Contemplation in Action” show how to integrate this gentle path into your daily rhythm, providing a foundation for greater self-awareness and wholeness.</p>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Art-of-Contemplation.jpg",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_N6A6Jb": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Activation Sequence Course",
            "text": "<p>The most popular of all Gene Keys courses, this self-study programme offers a profound introduction to your personal Gene Keys Profile.</p><p>Here you will awaken your Four Prime Gifts—the cornerstones of your <a href=\"https://www.gaia.com/series/gene-keys-unlocking-your-incarnation-codes\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">particular genius and life purpose</span></a>. As you walk the path of your Activation Sequence, the teachings come alive within you.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>What you will discover:</strong></p><ul><li>A personalized map of your Shadow patterns, Gifts, and higher purpose</li><li>How life’s challenges become fuel for your creative genius</li><li>Conditions for breakthrough and core stability before higher states of consciousness</li><li>The difference between your outer work (which may change) and your highest purpose (which never changes)</li></ul>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Activation-Sequence.jpg",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_VtwBBW": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Venus Sequence Course",
            "text": "<p>The Venus Sequence invites you on one of the deepest inner journeys you may ever take. This self-study online course explores unconscious patterns carried within your DNA and guides you toward living with an open heart.</p><p>As you apply its insights, your relationships transform, offering a new vision of what is possible in love, intimacy, and compassion.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>What you will discover:</strong></p><ul><li>A personalized map of your wound patterns and their childhood origins</li><li>How to release wounds through self-acceptance and forgiveness</li><li>How your relationships serve as the quickest path to awakening</li><li>Emotional intelligence practices that refine your awareness</li><li>The truth that your Core Wound is also your greatest gift of service</li></ul><p><strong>Features include:</strong></p><ul><li>13 modules with videos, <a href=\"https://www.gaia.com/series/richard-rudd-gene-keys-guided-meditations\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">meditations</span></a>, and contemplative tasks</li><li>Teachings that explain each part of your Profile and Venus Sequence</li><li>Your personalized Gene Keys Profile is embedded into the course</li><li>6 audio contemplations by Richard Rudd on your Venus Gene Keys</li><li>5 guided musical meditations to deepen your journey</li><li>Notes function to track progress in our updated learning platform</li></ul>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/The-Venus-Sequence.jpg",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "dropdown_AEhcyE": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "The Pearl Sequence Course",
            "text": "<p>The Pearl Sequence offers an alternative to chasing outer success by showing you how prosperity flows naturally through alignment with your inner wisdom.</p><p>This inspiring online course teaches you how to decode your Pearl Sequence and liberate a new flow of prosperity. It emphasizes freedom over accumulation and guides you to embody your authentic presence in both life and work.</p>",
            "dropdown_text": "<p><strong>What you will discover:</strong></p><ul><li>A personalized map of your Pearl Sequence and prosperity pathway</li><li>How to transmit the essence of your Vocation with confidence</li><li>Where and how you best fit within any culture, organization, or global community</li><li>How to embody your personal brand with clarity and elegance</li><li>The distinction between wealth (accumulation) and prosperity (flow)</li></ul>",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Pearl-Sequence.jpg",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        }
      },
