    "testimonials_UiBTpr": {
      "type": "testimonials",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonial_aCbra3": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>There were so many aha's and revelations that came to me from engaging with this program... Balancing my need for alone time and need to interacting with other people. Deeper insights into the Gene Keys and my amazing gifts, graciousness, transmutation,<br/>artfulness and synergy. How the keynotes remind me to flow...flowing with the rhythms of nature and life itself. I found the meditations enchanting and powerful - it was easy for me to go on the journeys and experience the gifts that came from those journeys.</p>",
            "author": "Barbara VanDen Burg",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_Ei33bT": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>The coherence and consistency of the program was felt throughout. As a coach myself, I know the impact of consistency and I felt this in every contact with the sequence - words, audio, videos, Q&A, your team, etc. This consistency has given me great trust in the material and therefore its encouragement to go deeply, slowly and safely. I had not done much shadow work coming into the Gene Keys and now I know why... it's not easy and it requires certain environmental conditions and teachers to do so. Acknowledging my shadows and having a partner who could do the same, as well as allow for my deep contemplation, has profoundly changed my life at all levels. And it is/will profoundly impact my contribution to the world. The organization of this program and your website and content in general is absolutely TOP TIER and of course, simple :) Thank you for taking the MANY efforts to give this material so elegantly :) I am feeling way more in my body. I am working through things within myself much more and at a much deeper level. I am in a very healthy relationship. and it is the center of my life.</p>",
            "author": "Dana Burkholder",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_xnyAcy": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>The evolution in understanding myself and being reminded to love myself and show myself grace while doing so. Not only have I seen and felt the transmutation within myself, the change within my relationships with others is almost unrecognizable. Relationships that were crumbling found a new sense of life. The compassion and understanding, while allowing myself to not need to understand the other fully has been life changing. My life truly is filled with more love, beauty, grace and simplicity and I feel lighter than ever although my heart has seemed to quadruple in size. The transformation within myself and within my relationships with others, as well as Mother Gaia as a whole, truly is one of the most incredible things to witness as I look at myself from outside of my body. Truly life changing. I cannot recommend this journey enough. If you are willing to embark upon this path with an open heart and open mind, I absolutely assure you the benefits you will receive will transform your world in the most beautiful way.</p>",
            "author": "Andrea",
            "author_info": ""
          }
        },
        "testimonial_BDFnH4": {
          "type": "testimonial",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "5-stars",
            "testimonial": "<p>Thank you for this opportunity to let my heart burst in this environment of safety and understanding. My gratitude is beyond words, but it bubbles up and ripples out in my dance, alone and with others. Grace (22.6) is my core and vocation, never knew this so precisely...but now at my 65th, everything falls into place. The whole profile is my home from which I am living without knowing it. So, the pearl will follow and then more... I bow to you all and especially Richard for bringing this into existence, namaste. All the keys come alive in me so I feel the strong freedom (to move up frequencies) and the profile is really my map, my guidance and safety.</p>",
            "author": "Ragyi Scholten",
            "author_info": "Los Angeles, CA"
          }
        }
      },
