    "6a2fb62f-79e7-42de-acea-4e5fab243fb0": {
      "type": "columns-1",
      "blocks": {
        "12d522a9-b741-4d4c-9b79-bb469c9fa36d": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How to become a Gene Keys reader?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Becoming a Gene Keys reader begins with learning how to contemplate your own Profile. As you deepen your personal practice, you naturally gain the ability to guide others. Courses like the Activation Sequence and Venus Sequence provide a strong foundation for sharing the wisdom with integrity.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "8b288a22-fe25-4939-a8bc-2bd82abe3281": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is the IQ in Gene Keys?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>In the Gene Keys, the IQ refers to your Intellectual Quotient, one of the stages in the Venus Sequence. It highlights patterns in how you think and communicate, and how these can transform from limiting behaviors into gifts of insight and clarity.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "fada70bb-9ebc-48cd-87d2-ba2bb418ab07": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "What is the Gene Key weakness?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Each Gene Key describes a Shadow, which can be thought of as a weakness or limiting pattern. Through contemplation, these Shadows reveal the hidden energy of your Gifts—your true strengths waiting to emerge.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "36d254e6-c118-4eb9-868e-c7838412525e": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Are Gene Keys the same as Human Design gates?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>The Gene Keys and Human Design share the same source material from the 64 hexagrams of the I Ching. Human Design speaks of “gates,” while the Gene Keys focus on a more contemplative and poetic journey. Both systems complement each other, but the Gene Keys emphasize a gentle path of reflection and self-illumination.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "64c54989-1338-47b7-bd63-ddfa422511b7": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "How to read Gene Keys?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Reading your Gene Keys starts with your personal Profile, which maps out key sequences such as Activation, Venus, and Pearl. By contemplating each Gene Key slowly—through audio, text, and guided practices—you begin to see how its wisdom plays out in your everyday life.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "19434ac0-1bc8-4fa7-9407-033dd509cb20": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Do I need to juice every day?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>No. If you don't have a lot of time in the morning, we suggest juicing the night before to stock up for the next day or two.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "195adf6e-7d69-4458-9adb-eaa295bb77f4": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Can I do this detox in winter?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Yes. This program has been designed for all seasons. You'll find a list of optional vegetable broths, dairy-free lattes, nut milks, and herbal teas if you'd like to add in something more.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "78097ffe-c976-4945-a965-5f25431986b6": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "If I have an illness or disease or take any kind of medication, can I still do The Juice Detox?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>We recommend seeking advice from your health care professional before starting the detox or any new diet.</p>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "ba6c8e79-47b1-4fea-9b1b-6118ceaef2f2": {
          "type": "dropdown",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "reveal": false,
            "title": "Whats the difference between the Warmer and Cooler Months  meal plans?",
            "text": "",
            "dropdown_text": "<p>Each meal plan consists of a juice for breakfast and lunch, whereas the cooler months meal plan includes a warming soup at dinner. You can do either, no matter where you live.</p><h3></h3>",
            "dropdown_image_fill": true,
            "background_color": "#ffffff",
            "text_color": ""
          }
        },
        "2d640ced-1117-4913-99c0-156ddce29838": {
          "type": "button",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "link": "#offer",
            "link_text": "Enroll Now",
            "link_entitled": "",
            "link_text_entitled": "",
            "align_button": "center"
          }
        },
        "heading_J3kBwF": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Support on Your Gene Keys Journey",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "3d4d5aae-2223-42d0-8dc4-411d1eb43905": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": false,
            "text": "<p>This 4-course bundle forms a foundation for self-study and integration, but it also connects you to a vibrant global network of seekers. With resources such as online retreats, webinars, frequently asked questions, and guides programmes, you’ll always have the tools and support you need.</p><p>Whether you are beginning your Gene Keys journey or deepening your practice, the Algorithm of Awakening is a living invitation to wholeness, transformation, and illumination.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
